WEBVTT

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:07.400
That's a lot of thinking.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.510
Hrm, well...

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:10.580
Okay!

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:11.580
I've decided!

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:13.420
You're conceding?

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:15.040
I'm going next door.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:16.260
Just wait for a bit.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:17.090
Huh?

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:20.010
He ran away.

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:55.570
I wonder if maybe my brother likes Mari-san.

00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:57.030
How come?

00:01:57.030 --> 00:02:00.590
Well, because there are eight of us,
I thought that might be why.

00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:02.680
Yukirin-san with Tsuyoshi-san.

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:04.560
Anna-san with Natsuki-san,

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:06.250
and Keiichi-san with me!

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:11.830
Plus, this afternoon, my brother rescued
Mari-san from guys who were hitting on her.

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:12.690
Wow!

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:14.710
Mattsuntsukutsun's so cool!

00:02:14.710 --> 00:02:16.770
Not sure if he actually likes her,

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:18.440
but they'd make a great couple!

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:19.520
I know, right?

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:21.510
I'll work hard for my love, too!

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:24.390
Wow, Nonnon, you're surprisingly aggressive!

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:26.580
You may be right!

00:02:28.990 --> 00:02:30.980
You think they found Marippe?

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:33.230
Coming!

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:35.400
Hm?

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:38.490
Pardon me!

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:41.960
Kei... Keiichi-san!

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:44.930
It's obvious that the girls' room would be tidy.

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:46.660
You've got all your luggage put away.

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:53.100
Um, uh, where did Yukirin-san go?

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:54.540
To the boys' room.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:58.880
Since the chance came up, I thought we'd
give her some alone time with Tsuyopon.

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:03.220
I knew Keiichi-san was kind!

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:05.760
<i>Mattsun'll probably be mad.</i>

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:08.620
<i>But if I just don't say anything
weird to her, it's all good, right?</i>

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.290
I-I'll make some tea!

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.730
Please, sit down!

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:15.520
Huh?

00:03:15.850 --> 00:03:16.860
Why you?

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:19.780
Kei-kun passed the baton to me.

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:23.000
Oh, so that's what he left to do.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.530
What's this? Am I not good enough for you?

00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:29.500
Of course you're good enough.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:31.790
Tsuyoponnu!

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:36.040
I've been wanting to pick up
where we left off on the bus.

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:37.550
Me too!

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:42.930
Well, then!

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:45.220
Anything you wanna do?

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:49.160
Uh... um...

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:50.340
How about...

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:56.610
I'm really glad we found you.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:58.530
Sorry to worry you, Anna!

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:02.360
Thank you boys for your help, too.

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:03.690
It's fine.

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:05.990
Come to think of it, I'm quite awesome, aren't I?

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:09.090
Even with her curled up, hiding her face,

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:11.930
I could still tell it was Mari-chan.
Isn't that amazing?

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:12.600
Isn't it?

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.620
Not really. That's normal.

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:19.500
What happened to "being more honest"?

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.190
That's all over!

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:22.010
Huh?!

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:23.330
Hold on.

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:25.800
It's nighttime. Could you two keep it down?

00:04:27.050 --> 00:04:28.510
I guess I should say...

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:33.890
I also kind of think of you guys
as my friends.

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:36.060
Thanks for looking for me.

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:38.090
Huh? Uh, sure.

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:39.650
Don't worry about it.

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:41.150
Mari-chan.

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:42.740
What is it?

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:44.700
Mari-chan.

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:47.070
You seem cuter than usual.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.670
Again! Say it again, Anna!

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:52.450
You're cuter than usual.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:54.340
Oh, but you're always cute.

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:56.040
Oh, Anna!

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:58.170
Let's hurry up and get playing, Anna!

00:04:58.170 --> 00:04:58.860
Okay.

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:02.870
Huh? What is it?

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:03.880
Hm?

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:06.180
Oh, welcome back, Na-chan!

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:11.510
I'm glad to see you found Tsutsui-san.

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:14.150
Keiichi-san, does that feel good?

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:17.060
It does, thanks!

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:18.650
Keiichi!

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:20.280
Huh? What?
Keiichi!

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:22.530
Onii-chan, how long have you been here?!

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:26.110
Now we can all play together!

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:29.030
Or so I thought...

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:30.990
Why not?

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:32.450
Don't give me that.

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:35.950
Making me kneel in the hallway?
It's like I'm going to get lectured.

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:38.070
It's not "like."
That's exactly what's happening.

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:39.710
What? I don't wanna do this.

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:41.800
If you look down on me,
the whip's coming out.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:42.590
Put that away!

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:44.150
What is with you?

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:46.330
Why were you with Nozomi?

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:49.470
It's the result of me trying to be considerate.

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:51.730
After I swapped rooms with Yukirin,

00:05:51.730 --> 00:05:54.610
Nozomi-chan said she wanted
to give me a massage.

00:05:54.610 --> 00:05:55.740
Nozomi...

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:57.780
What's that girl even thinking?!

00:05:57.780 --> 00:05:59.360
Should I have refused?

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:01.830
Hell yes! A sexy massage like that...

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:03.240
Sexy?

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:05.900
Won't you be mad if Nozomi-chan
was sad because I'd refused?

00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:10.170
What a pain.

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:11.520
Either way.

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:14.540
I'm telling you to make sure
no "mistakes" happen.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:17.830
It's weird having you tell me how to behave...

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:19.950
But, it'll all be fine!

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:21.910
Really, now?

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:22.750
Huh?

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.760
You two were out here?

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:26.840
Yeah...

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:29.030
Where are you headed?

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:31.110
We're out of ice, so I'm getting some.

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:34.600
Keiichi can go get that.
You head back to the room.

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:36.930
We'll call it even after this.

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:38.530
Hm.

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:39.560
Roger that.

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:45.690
Onii-chan, what were you
talking to Keiichi-san about?

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:48.280
Oh, just some guy talk.

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:50.490
Come on, let's go in.

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:53.530
Huh?

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:56.330
Oh, it's making ice now?

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:59.930
<i>I just don't know what to do about Mattsun.</i>

00:06:59.930 --> 00:07:03.250
<i>Sure, I get why he'd be worried.</i>

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:07.080
<i>Nozomi-chan would be pretty startled
if she found out what I'm into, after all.</i>

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:07.710
Hm?

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:10.990
You startled me!

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:11.950
What's up?

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:14.850
I felt bad you got sent for ice,
so I decided to come, too.

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:16.050
What?

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:17.990
Mattsun will get mad at me.

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:21.050
I wanted to apologize to you for that, too.

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:24.910
I'm sorry my brother got mad at you over me.

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:26.020
No, it's fine.

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:30.360
But I was thrilled that I got to massage you.

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:31.270
Uh...

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:33.410
But, still...

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:37.410
I don't understand why he got so upset.

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:40.330
It just means he's concerned for you.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:41.810
Why?

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:45.250
You're his friend.
That ought to put him at ease.

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:47.940
Onii-chan worries too much.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:49.170
I just...

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:52.590
I just like you, is all...

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.870
S-Sorry!

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:57.010
No, no.

00:07:57.470 --> 00:08:00.460
Um... sorry.

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:01.850
To tell you the truth,

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:05.800
older women are actually my type.

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:08.820
He knows that, so Mattsun was trying
to stop you indirectly.

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:10.280
Is that all?

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:11.070
Huh?

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:13.660
Type is just an ideal, right?

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:16.120
Uh... well, I guess so.

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:18.220
I don't mind that.

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:21.040
I mean, yes, I'd be happy
if I matched your type perfectly.

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:24.460
But I won't be shocked
and give up just because I don't.

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:27.290
Wow, she's tough!

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:29.600
I'm serious.

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:32.750
You're cool, and very kind.

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:38.690
And I get the feeling that you'll
introduce me to a whole new world...

00:08:38.690 --> 00:08:41.430
You're pretty perceptive...

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:43.350
Perceptive?

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:47.450
But I still think you should give up.

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:50.270
I'm sure you'll be put off by it.
That happens all the time.

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:53.610
I won't be put off by anything!

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:55.400
Are you sure?

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:56.700
Yes!

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:59.120
Are you sure...?

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:05.500
Oh, it's finally ready!

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:12.590
Keiichi-san.

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:15.090
What was that just now?

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:16.050
What do you mean?

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:19.470
Do you have many different faces?

00:09:20.670 --> 00:09:21.390
Maybe.

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:25.310
Hey, aren't you coming?

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:28.320
It startled me.

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:30.120
It startled me, but...

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:31.610
It's strange.

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:33.840
I'm all excited.

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:36.240
You were so cool.

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:39.160
If you have more faces to show me,

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:41.580
then I want to see them!

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:44.000
Is that strange of me?

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:45.370
You're...

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:46.530
You're strange!

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:47.500
Ah!

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:48.590
Maybe.

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:49.390
Maybe?

00:09:49.390 --> 00:09:50.980
Just kidding. I don't know.

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:54.340
Nobody near my age ever told me that before.

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:56.340
Oh, really?

00:09:56.340 --> 00:09:57.520
Yeah.

00:09:57.520 --> 00:09:59.760
Maybe that's why I prefer older women.

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:02.180
Then... how about it?

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:05.480
Do you mind if I try my best?

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:09.900
Is it okay if I work my hardest
to make you love me?

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:14.030
<i>I'm not very fond of girls
pursuing me that hard, but...</i>

00:10:14.030 --> 00:10:16.820
<i>I might be a little interested.</i>

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:18.700
Sure. It's fine.

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:21.530
Catch me if you can!

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:23.660
Okay! I'll do my best!

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:24.410
Well, then.

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:26.870
Shall we swap numbers?

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:27.870
Can we?

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:29.880
Hm, hold on...

00:10:29.880 --> 00:10:33.140
Mattsun'll be pissed, so maybe I shouldn't.

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:34.250
Oh, well!

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:36.920
Keep it our secret.

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:39.690
I will!

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:41.890
Tell him and I'll pun—

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:42.980
I mean, no telling!

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:43.720
Okay!

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:47.770
The bus is here!

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:50.980
We made it!

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:52.680
You're late!

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:53.770
Oh, sorry.

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:57.360
Mattsun slept in, but still went for a bath.

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:59.200
You took one too!

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:01.090
I woke up early.

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:01.590
I planned to wake up early, too.

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:03.570
Mari-chan, wasn't this fun?

00:11:03.570 --> 00:11:04.560
Yeah!

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.330
Mari-chan, wasn't this fun?

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:07.370
Buzz off!

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:08.930
What was that for?!

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:10.710
You should just say "yeah!"

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:12.130
I already said it to Anna!

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:13.540
Well, say it to me, too!

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:15.750
<i>Dear Mattsun,</i>

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:19.210
<i>I have some... disappointing news for you.</i>

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:22.420
<i>Nozomi-chan just might have potential.</i>

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:24.900
<i>For that.</i>
